{{TOC|align=right}}
Stardew Valley Expanded adds 42 new consumable '''Food''' items to the game, all available via cooking, crafting, or by purchasing from various vendors. 

Cooking is a vanilla game mechanic that becomes available after receiving/purchasing a [[Stardew:Cookout Kit|Cookout Kit]] or by [[Stardew:Farmhouse#Upgrades|upgrading the farmhouse]] for the first time.

{{Info|For clarity, vanilla game mechanics can be referenced at: [[Stardew:Cooking|Stardew Valley wiki - Cooking]].}}


